# cross-repo pin: build.sh builds whatever this checkout is. The
# package version (VERSION) must equal the release tag version.
# Validated against v0.3.0 (tag object d883a284, commit 9306d60c).
# Caddy: installed from the distro repo at install time (Debian 12 / Ubuntu 24.04).
# Caddy: official release binary, bundled at build time (no distro repo needed).
